        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Chandgi Ram, Sonika Kaliraman\n- Events: 1970 Asian Games, 1972 Summer Olympics\n- Places: Bangkok, Thailand\n\nFacts:\n- The 6th Asian Games were held in Bangkok, Thailand, from December 9, 1970, to December 20, 1970.\n- Chandgi Ram won a gold medal at the 1970 Asian Games.\n- Chandgi Ram represented India in the 1972 Summer Olympics.\n- Sonika Kaliraman is the daughter of former wrestler Chandgi Ram, also known as Master Chadgiram.",
